  <title>Overview of integration practice exam</title>

    <p>The Integration Practice Exam is identical to the actual Integration Exam except that you get immediate feedback and solutions.  (The actual Integration Exam won't tell you if you get the answer right.)</p>
      
  <p>Just like for the Integration Exam, the practice exam consists of 6 problems.  Each problem is on its own page.  You can switch pages with the Previous and Next buttons.</p>

  <p>The problems are randomly generated.  To create a new practice exam with 6 new problems, click the New Attempt button.</p>